id: weapon-fixer
name: Weapon Fixer
advancement: true
prerequisite: Magical Materialization
tpCost: 5
weaponFixer: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Weapon equipped through Telekinesis regains twice your Might in Life Points.
text: >
  Weapon Fixer: You are able to telekinetically put Weapons back together.
  –Prerequisites: Magical Materialization
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: If you equip a Weapon through the effects of the Telekinesis Unique Ability, that Weapon may regain Life
  Points equal to twice your Might.
